{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \nこんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、「五月雨よ」MVが公開されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、フィルムカメラを使ったMV撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、完成された映像がどうなっているのかな？と、ドキドキしていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大自然の中で、温かさを感じられるそんなMVになっているのではないかなと思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの心が温かくなれば、嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に好きなシーンは、みんなで坂を下りながら歩くシーンかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も坂を登って下ってを繰り返して楽しかったです笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、ぜひご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0W3A2PC4JSNBK1EK03YWKP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0W3B44VP1WVWED1AJEAEJA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにか面白いことでもあったのかな？ってくらい笑ってますね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0W3C5P50JJ0WVG3M6YRCZ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0W3D7AV2B89TDG6HRG6N3S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目が合いました？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4枚ともゆみこかめらでございます。\n感謝、感謝🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0W3E7R278GNYW68REAJV71","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは私が撮った写真！\n上手ですか？？　綺麗に撮れたと思うんだけどなー、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと撮った写真は、またブログに載せますねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「五月雨よ」オンラインミート&グリートの第5次応募受付が今日から始まっています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すでに、レターなどで行くよー！という声もあり、皆さんに会える日が楽しみです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとお喋りしながら、楽しい時間を過ごせたら嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第5次応募受付締め切りは今日3月17日14時までとなっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくはこちらからどうぞ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://fortunemusic.jp/sakurazaka46_202204/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0W3FB10QHDKTDMN79Y0SE4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるよー🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいば〜い🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}],"source":"archive"}